+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-spc-001"></a>
+
+The clinic also publishes the specialties it knows (stated by the product owner 2026-08-11). Every specialty appears under the name the clinic stores it by, each one followed by the veterinarians who hold it, first name then last `[REQ-SPC-001]`. The whole list is shown at once, however long it runs. A veterinarian holding no specialty appears nowhere on it — the page publishes specialties, not the roster of veterinarians. The page changes nothing: it offers no way to alter a specialty or who holds it. It is reached by its own address alone — no navigation entry names it, and no other page links to it.
+
+**Done when:**
+- `[REQ-SPC-001]` given the clinic's specialties, when the directory is opened, then every one of them is listed under the name it is stored by.
+- `[REQ-SPC-001]` given a specialty that veterinarians hold, when the directory is opened, then each of those veterinarians is listed under it by first name then last name.
+- `[REQ-SPC-001]` given a veterinarian holding no specialty, when the directory is opened, then that veterinarian appears nowhere on the page.
+- `[REQ-SPC-001]` given the clinic's specialties, when the directory is opened, then all of them are shown at once and nothing is offered to page through.
+- `[REQ-SPC-001]` given the directory, when it is opened, then it offers no way to add, rename, or remove a specialty, and none to change who holds one.
+- `[REQ-SPC-001]` given any page of the system, when it is rendered, then nothing on it leads to the specialty directory.
+- `[REQ-SPC-001]` given the supported languages, when the directory's wording is checked, then every piece of it is present in each of them, as `REQ-LANG-002` requires.
+
+**Edge cases:**
+1. A specialty no veterinarian holds is still listed, with no veterinarian under it.
+2. A veterinarian holding more than one specialty is listed under each of them.
+3. The specialties, and the veterinarians under each, are presented in a stable order rather than an arbitrary one.
+4. When the clinic knows no specialty at all, the page is shown with nothing listed rather than failing.
+
+**Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
+
